FTX+AAI+++FACT: Business Model: B2B wholesale distributor. Direct supply from Asian production to European retail partners. No intermediary, no broker, no middleman. No consumer sales. No public advertising. No online shop. No direct consumer marketing. Closed partner network. 9 years continuous operations.'
